    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play Vesna, a healer responsible for helping the villagers coexist with the supernatural beings that live in the mountain. Some call you a witch while others, like Sana, call you a friend. To help the people afflicted by spirits, you\u2019ll need to record your recipes and find ingredients scattered throughout the mountain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Help Sana</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sana, an old friend, is hiding her eyes. To find out what's wrong, you should make her favorite tea, but there\u2019s a problem: you\u2019re slowly losing your memory. Will you remember the recipe?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/949275787a7b925620c025d8239a94a7.poster.avif?t=1734905722\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/949275787a7b925620c025d8239a94a7.webm?t=1734905722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/949275787a7b925620c025d8239a94a7.mp4?t=1734905722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Remember your recipes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your hands, cooking has the power to cure strange ailments caused by spiritual distress. Living so close to the spirits has addled your mind, but you can trigger memories of your most potent recipes by exploring the environment.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/77b4055e42201849bf89987d1a4c5be1.poster.avif?t=1734905722\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/77b4055e42201849bf89987d1a4c5be1.webm?t=1734905722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/77b4055e42201849bf89987d1a4c5be1.mp4?t=1734905722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather the right ingredients</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mountain is full of herbs, flowers, and seeds you can use in your cooking, and if you look closely, you\u2019re sure to find some less conventional ingredients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/7dc246115ebcf55181705311c0c114f9.poster.avif?t=1734905722\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/7dc246115ebcf55181705311c0c114f9.webm?t=1734905722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/7dc246115ebcf55181705311c0c114f9.mp4?t=1734905722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Heal with cooking</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook a mix of traditional Slavic dishes, drinks from distant lands, and a few strange concoctions to heal the physical and spiritual ailments of the people you meet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/55c30ce1b9f05ec7b83b4dbfbe10092f.poster.avif?t=1734905722\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/55c30ce1b9f05ec7b83b4dbfbe10092f.webm?t=1734905722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/55c30ce1b9f05ec7b83b4dbfbe10092f.mp4?t=1734905722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn the laws of the land</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unseen, ancient beings dwell in the mountains. Like a sentient script, they tie the realm of thought to the physical world and shape the matter around them. As a healer, you speak their language and use it to help other people whose thoughts have transformed their reality. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/a3d65cf646bdf150fa021e6abbe829e4.poster.avif?t=1734905722\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/a3d65cf646bdf150fa021e6abbe829e4.webm?t=1734905722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/a3d65cf646bdf150fa021e6abbe829e4.mp4?t=1734905722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play Vesna, a healer responsible for helping the villagers coexist with the supernatural beings that live in the mountain. Some call you a witch while others, like Sana, call you a friend. To help the people afflicted by spirits, you\u2019ll need to record your recipes and find ingredients scattered throughout the mountain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Help Sana</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sana, an old friend, is hiding her eyes. To find out what's wrong, you should make her favorite tea, but there\u2019s a problem: you\u2019re slowly losing your memory. Will you remember the recipe?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/949275787a7b925620c025d8239a94a7.poster.avif?t=1734905722\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/949275787a7b925620c025d8239a94a7.webm?t=1734905722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/949275787a7b925620c025d8239a94a7.mp4?t=1734905722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Remember your recipes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your hands, cooking has the power to cure strange ailments caused by spiritual distress. Living so close to the spirits has addled your mind, but you can trigger memories of your most potent recipes by exploring the environment.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/77b4055e42201849bf89987d1a4c5be1.poster.avif?t=1734905722\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"